    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0227" n="131" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg131"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-05-26"><hi rendition="#italic">May 26,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Situation unchanged. If it is necessary, and the other powers bring them to
                    Pekin, can I arrange with the admiral for legation guards?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
